239	    /**
240	     * Normalizes a value for duplicate detection so that comparisons ignore letter case and
241	     * surrounding or repeated whitespace. Leading and trailing whitespace is stripped, any run
242	     * of internal whitespace collapses to a single space, and the result is lower-cased. For
243	     * example {@code "  John   Smith "} and {@code "John Smith"} both normalize to
244	     * {@code "john smith"}.
245	     *
246	     * @param value the value to normalize, may be {@code null}
247	     * @return the normalized value, or {@code null} if {@code value} is {@code null}
248	     */
